  {
   "index": 12,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 277,
   "text": "Vue (pronounced /vjuː/, like view) is a JavaScript framework for building user interfaces. It builds on top of standard HTML, CSS, and JavaScript and provides a declarative, component-based programming model that helps you efficiently develop user interfaces of any complexity.",
   "counts": {
