  },
  {
   "index": 19,
   "tag": "div",
   "class": "tip custom-block",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 431,
   "text": "Prerequisites\nThe rest of the documentation assumes basic familiarity with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. If you are totally new to frontend development, it might not be the best idea to jump right into a framework as your first step - grasp the basics and then come back! You can check your knowledge level with these overviews for JavaScript, HTML and CSS if needed. Prior experience with other framewo",
