  {
   "index": 23,
   "tag": "p×3",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 920,
   "text": "If you find these concepts intimidating, don't worry! The tutorial and guide only require basic HTML and JavaScript knowledge, and you should be able to follow along without being an expert in any of these.\nIf you are an experienced developer interested in how to best integrate Vue into your stack, or you are curious about what these terms mean, we discuss them in more detail in Ways of Using Vue.",
