   "textLength": 1147,
   "text": "Both API styles are fully capable of covering common use cases. They are different interfaces powered by the exact same underlying system. In fact, the Options API is implemented on top of the Composition API! The fundamental concepts and knowledge about Vue are shared across the two styles.\nThe Options API is centered around the concept of a \"component instance\" (this as seen in the example), whi",
   "counts": {
